From 97abd9ad4e820f3f245c1d476072017bed2d9c7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The browser Authors <noreply@browser.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:13:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 20/55] markdown-viewer

A built-in viewer for text/markdown: a read-only MV2 component extension
that takes every markdown response the way the PDF viewer takes PDFs,
offline and without a write path. .md and .markdown map to text/markdown
in the primary MIME table and join the file types the browser registers
itself for. The bundle (Milkdown, ProseMirror, remark, CodeMirror, KaTeX,
Vue, DOMPurify; see README.chromium and LICENSE) is generated by the
viewer's build script. The component-loader and allowlist hunks ride in
docs-offline-stub.
